rule     et_numbr     money_range      ours: a hyphen straight after a sum of money and before another sum or a number is a range, five dollars to ten dollars, as two numbers are; 4.3 and 6.1 both read nothing for it, and 6.1 says dash where a currency sign follows
rule     u_integ      monetary_exp     IBM's, asking eng_monetary_exp_43 when 6.1's eng_monetary_exp declines, and money_range after either reads a sum
rule     u_integ      convert_monetary_exp IBM's, asking money_range after the sum is read
